## Log respecification

Underprediction at both extremes is a hallmark of a multiplicative process fitted on an additive scale. The factors associated with purchasing power operate proportionally, so the same shift in an input moves a high purchasing power county by more dollars than a low one. Logging the outcome converts those proportional differences into the additive form a linear model assumes. @fig-log-transform shows the outcome before and after the transformation.
:::

